d to pick one of the two options," Lazea said.   \par \par \uc2 By 1500 GMT, the leu was quoted at 3.1265/25 per euro <EURRON=> compared with a five-year high of 3.0870 hit last Monday.   \par \par \uc2 ROMANIA-CBANK/ (UPDATE 1)|LANGEN|ABN|M|D|RDN|GNN|DNP   \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020070711e37b0019l\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
