\par\par \b \uc2 Romania - Factors to Watch on June 25   \b0\par\par\uc2 513 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 25 Juni 2007\par 07:59\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2007 Reuters Limited   \par \par \uc2 BUCHAREST, June 25 (Reuters) - Here are news stories, press reports and events to watch which may affect Romanian financial markets on Monday.   \par \par \uc2 C.BANK MEETING   \par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  (BNR) board holds its monetary policy meeting. Eight out of 12 analysts polled by Reuters last week expect the bank to cut its benchmark rate by at least 25 basis points to 7 percent.   \par \par \uc2 BUDGET DATA   \par \par \uc2 The Finance and Economy Ministry may issue official budget data for the first five months.   \par \par \uc2 MONEY SUPPLY DATA   \par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  may release May money supply data.   \par \par \uc2 NASTASE TRIAL   \par \par \uc2 Former Prime Minister Adrian Nastase is called for the first hearings at the Supreme Court of Justice in a new graft trial against him.   \par \par \uc2 ROMANIA CENBANK GOV-PREFER \b \highlight22\uc2 CURRENCY\b0 \highlight\uc2  TO FIND OWN LEVEL   \par \par \uc2 Romania's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  is concerned that the strength of the leu will prove unsustainable but would prefer the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  to find its own level, its governor said on Friday.   \par \par \uc2 In an interview with Reuters, Mugur Isarescu played down a jump in the leu to a fresh 4-1/2 year high against the euro on Friday, and said the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  was focused on longer-term trends.   \par \par \uc2 [ID:nL22846062]   \par \par \uc2 LEU AT 4-1/2 HIGHS AFTER CBANK COMMENTS   \par \par \uc2 The Romanian leu surged almost one percent to a new 4-1/2 high on Friday, outperforming the emerging sector as the country's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  head signalled there were no immediate plans to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  and stem its rise.   \par \par \uc2 [ID:nL22646518]   \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ROMANIA\b0 \highlight\uc2  MAY BUY WHEAT FROM EU'S \b \highlight22\uc2 INTERVENTION\b0 \highlight\uc2  STOCKS   \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Romania\b0 \highlight\uc2  may be forced to buy wheat from the European Union's \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  stocks after a prolonged drought scorched thousands of hectares under grain, officials said on Friday.   \par \par \uc2 [ID:nL2296072]   \par \par \uc2 FIGHT AGAINST FRAUD STALLS IN ROMANIA AND BULGARIA   \par \par \uc2 Six months after joining the European Union, Romania and Bulgaria have failed to demonstrate credible progress in fighting systemic corruption and organised crime, despite broad legislative reforms.   \par \par \uc2 [ID:nL22875832]   \par \par \uc2 ROMANIAN ANTI-GRAFT DRIVE AT RISK, CAMPAIGNERS WARN   \par \par \uc2 Rights groups warned on Sunday that attempts by Romania's government and parliament to pass laws protecting private interests risk undermining the new European Union member's anti-corruption reforms.   \par \par \uc2 [ID:nL24625571]   \par \par \uc2 PIC SALES   \par \par \uc2 Romanian retailer Pic expects its sales to rise by 50 percent on the year to 90 million euros ($121.1 million) in 2007, after investments in network expansion   \par \par \uc2 Ziarul Financiar, page 9   \par \par \uc2 NOTE - For a diary of forthcoming Romanian events, double click [RO/DIARY], and a calendar of east European economic indicators, see [CONV/DIARY].   \par \par \uc2 For other related news, double click on:    \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  ---------------------------------------------------------------\par  Romania Market Debt     [RO-DBT]   Romanian \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 forex\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2       [RO-FRX]\par  Romania Market Report   [ROL/]     Romanian