\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Romania \highlight\uc2  c.bank cautious about  \highlight22\uc2 intervention \highlight\uc2 -MNSI   \b0\par\par\uc2 191 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 22 Juni 2007\par 10:31\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2007 Reuters Limited   \par \par \uc2  BUCHAREST, June 22 (Reuters) - \b \highlight22\uc2 Romania\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  will not \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  markets to stem the rise in the leu unless it becomes "deeply concerned" about appreciation, \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  head Mugur Isarescu was quoted as saying on Friday.   \par \par \uc2  News agency MNSI reported Isarescu saying on the sidelines of a  \uc2 Swiss National Bank\uc2  event in Zurich that he would not fully rule out \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 .   \par \par \uc2  "As long as we are not deeply concerned with the exchange rate developments, we are not \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  and we did not for almost two years," Isarescu said.   \par \par \uc2  "But to say publicly that I never will \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in my view is too much, at least for a small open economy," he said.   \par \par \uc2  The Romanian leu hit its highest level against the euro in four and a half years on Friday, hitting 3.1920 per euro <EURRON=> after a week of sharp gains.   \par \par \uc2  The bank has cut interest rates by 150 basis points so far this year, bringing the benchmark rate to 7.25 percent, in part due to concerns about leu appreciation.      \par \par \uc2 ROMANIA-CBANK/|LANGEN|ABN|M|D   \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020070622e36m000l1\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
