\par\par \b \uc2 Romania - Factors to Watch on April 30   \b0\par\par\uc2 405 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 30 April 2007\par 08:13\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2007 Reuters Limited   \par \par \uc2 BUCHAREST, April 30 (Reuters) - Here are news stories, press reports and events to watch which may affect Romanian financial markets on Monday.   \par \par \uc2 PUBLIC HOLIDAY   \par \par \uc2 The government has set April 30 as public holiday ahead of Labour Day on Tuesday. Public institutions and the Bucharest stock exchange are closed, but the money market is opened.   \par \par \uc2 ROMANIAN CEN.BANK SEEN KEEPING RATES FLAT IN MAY   \par \par \uc2 Romania's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  is likely to keep its key interest rate unchanged in May, a slim majority of analysts forecast, as potential inflationary pressures later this year and a recent political crisis call for prudence.   \par \par \uc2 [ID:nL27192013]   \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 INTERVENTION\b0 \highlight\uc2  TALK BRIEFLY HURTS BUOYANT LEU   \par \par \uc2 The Romanian leu lost one percent against the euro on Friday, sliding away from its highest level in nearly five years amid speculation of \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 , later denied by the bank.   \par \par \uc2 [ID:nL27547418]   \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ROMANIA\b0 \highlight\uc2  TO HOLD NATO SUMMIT IN 2008   \par \par \uc2 New European Union member Romania will hold next year's NATO summit, the alliance's Secretary General Jaap de Hoop Scheffer said on Friday.   \par \par \uc2 [ID:nL27212697]   \par \par \uc2 ANTIBIOTICE TURNOVER UP 14 PCT Y/Y in Q1   \par \par \uc2 Romania's sole state-controlled drugmaker  \uc2 Antibiotice\uc2  Iasi , which authorities plan to privatise by October, said its turnover rose 14 percent on the year to 41.7 million lei ($17.08 million) in the first quarter of this year.   \par \par \uc2 Ziarul Financiar, page 5   \par \par \uc2 ALRO SEES 2007 TURNOVER DOWN   \par \par \uc2 Romania's Alro Slatina , one of Europe's largest aluminium smelters, forecast its turnover will decrease by 5 percent on the year to $741 million in 2007, while its net profit will remain steady at about $135 million.   \par \par \uc2 The company said the forecast is based on falling aluminium prices on commodities markets.   \par \par \uc2 Ziarul Financiar, page 5   \par \par \uc2 NOTE - For a diary of forthcoming Romanian events, double click [RO/DIARY], and a calendar of east European economic indicators, see [CONV/DIARY].   \par \par \uc2 For other related news, double click on:    \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  ---------------------------------------------------------------\par  Romania Market Debt     [RO-DBT]   Romanian \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 forex\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2       [RO-FRX]\par  Romania Market Report   [ROL/]     Romanian money      [RO-M]\par  Emerging Market Debt    [EMRG/DBT] Emerging \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 forex\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2     [EMRG/FRX]\par  All Emerging Markets news [EMRG]   CEE indicators  [CONV/DIARY]\par  All East Europe News       [EEU]   E.Europe equities     [.CEE]\par  TOP NEWS -- Emerging markets   [TOP/EMRG]\par  TOP NEWS -- Convergence watch  [TOP/EAST]\par  Romanian indicators        [RO/ECI]\par  Main page of Reuters poll  <RO/POLL1>\par  ---------------------------------------------------------------\par    \f28 \par \par \uc2 LANGEN|Table|RDN|REVU|G|RBN|GNN|RNP|DNP|PGE|PMF   \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020070430e34u000c8\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
