esday.  \par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  computed the indicative rate of the leu <FXRO01> at 3.5734 to the euro from 3.5580 on Wednesday and 2.9638 to the dollar from 2.9743. The rate is not compulsory for book-keeping or interbank deals. It is used by the Finance Ministry and customs for statistical purposes.  \par \par \uc2 MARKETS-ROMANIA-LEU|LANGEN|Table|RDN|GNN|ABN|M|D|RBN|RNP|DNP|PTD|PMF  \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020051006e1a6001g0\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
