round 8.1 percent of gross domestic product against a previous forecast of 7.75 percent of GDP.  \par \par \uc2 MARKETS-\b \highlight22\uc2 ROMANIA\b0 \highlight\uc2 -\b \highlight22\uc2 INTERVENTION\b0 \highlight\uc2  (UPDATE 1)|LANGEN|ABN|M|E|RBN|D|RDN|GNN|BNX|RNP|DNP  \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020051005e1a5000oo\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
