\par\par \b \uc2 UPDATE 1-Romanian c.bank  \highlight22\uc2 intervenes \highlight\uc2  again to curb leu rise  \b0\par\par\uc2 328 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 28 September 2005\par 12:22\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2005 Reuters Limited  \par \par \uc2 (Adds \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 , dealer's comment, background)  \par \par \uc2 BUCHAREST, Sept 28 (Reuters) - \b \highlight22\uc2 Romania\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  (BNR) \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  directly in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market for a second day on Wednesday, buying euros to stem a rise in the leu \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 , dealers said.  \par \par \uc2 The BNR has been battling a rapid rise of the leu since it slashed four zeros from the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  in July, despite its shift to inflation targeting, using \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  and keeping the money market swimming in excess liquidity to deter speculators.  \par \par \uc2 "It bought until it brought the leu to 3.5450 (per euro)," said a dealer with a foreign bank.  \par \par \uc2 BNR officials, who are usually tight-lipped about market \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2 , declined to comment. They have said in the past the BNR would keep managing the leu to prevent excessive swings despite adoption of inflation targeting in August.  \par \par \uc2 Dealers said the BNR started to buy euros at around 3.5300 per euro and estimated it had purchased between 20-50 million euros, a similar amount as in its Tuesday \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 .  \par \par \uc2 At 1030 GMT the leu <EURRON=> was quoted at 3.5380 per euro, down from its Tuesday's close of 3.5300/70.  \par \par \uc2 The leu weakened significantly last week, losing 2.5 percent to the euro - nearly all of its gains since the beginning of July - after the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  cut its policy rate by 100 basis points to 7.5 percent, citing slowing inflation.  \par \par \uc2 The unit recovered earlier this week to hit 3.5 per euro on Tuesday, as foreign investors and local corporates sold hard \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 .  \par \par \uc2 Traders said the BNR's Wednesday action indicated it probably wanted to keep the leu between 3.5400 and 3.5500 per euro.  \par \par \uc2 "It seems that 3.5400 is the level they want to protect for the moment," another dealer said.  \par \par \uc2 MARKETS-\b \highlight22\uc2 ROMANIA\b0 \highlight\uc2 -\b \highlight22\uc2 INTERVENTION\b0 \highlight\uc2  (UPDATE 1)|LANGEN|RDN|ABN|M|D|RBN|RNP|DNP|PTD|PMF  \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020050928e19s000rm\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
