\par\par \b \uc2 UPDATE 2- \highlight22\uc2 Romania \highlight\uc2  c.bank  \highlight22\uc2 intervenes \highlight\uc2  again to stem leu rise  \b0\par\par\uc2 By Martin Dokoupil  \par \uc2 525 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 17 August 2005\par 11:40\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2005 Reuters Limited  \par \par \uc2 (Adds analyst, dealer comments, background)  \par \par \uc2 BUCHAREST, Aug 17 (Reuters) - \b \highlight22\uc2 Romania\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  (BNR) \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  for the fourth day running on Wednesday to curb the rapid rise in the leu, but analysts said its ambitious inflation targets would force it to let it firm over thelonger term.  \par \par \uc2 The BNR has been trying to slow what is sees as excessive exchange rate movements since the leu hit its strongest level since December 2002 at 3.4000 to the euro last week.  \par \par \uc2 Some analysts said the BNR's tactics were too aggressive, given its policy shift to inflation targeting earlier this week, adding it also offered good entry levels for speculators.  \par \par \uc2 Others argued BNR policymakers seemed to have wanted to send a strong signal they would only allow gradual leu gains and that they would let it firm over the longer term to push inflation to a 5.0 percent target at end-2006 from 9.3 percent last year.  \par \par \uc2 "They are in a difficult position because there is a lot of non-resident inflows into the country and they have to obviously conduct monetary policy in a way that will bring down inflation," said Martin Blum, head of emerging market research at Bank Austria Creditanstalt.  \par \par \uc2 The BNR said on Monday it was launching an inflation targeting policy to better contain price pressures as the country moves closer to EU membership in 2007. It also reiterated it would keep its managed float regime.  \par \par \uc2 On Wednesday, dealers said the BNR \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  on the market at midday when the leu was trading at around 3.5400 bid per euro, pushing the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  down as far as 3.5900.  \par \par \uc2 The leu, which has gained roughly 10 percent this year, partly recovered later in the session, ending at 3.5650/50 per euro, down from Tuesday's close of 3.5550/50.  \par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 , which is often tight-lipped about its market moves, would not confirm the \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 .  \par \par \uc2 Dealers said the BNR's \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  were probably aimed at keeping the leu in a range of 3.5500-3.6000 per euro, but added the bank would find it hard to defend it over a longer term.  \par \par \uc2 "It will be very difficult for them to protect these levels because speculators are getting to Romania," said Finansbank chief dealer Sorin Moncea.  \par \par \uc2 The new "heavy" leu has been firming since its launch in July as the BNR softened slightly its tough exchange rate policy. It has been buoyed by seasonal hard \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  inflows from Romanians working abroad.  \par \par \uc2 Dealers estimated the BNR may have bought 100-200 million euros in its \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  on Wednesday after purchasing a combined 300 million euros ($368 million) in previous \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  since Friday.  \par \par \uc2 Short-term money market rates ended at 3.53/6.62 percent from 3.8/6.8 percent on Tuesday. The BNR did not drain money market liquidity via one-month deposit tenders since merging its key rates to a single 8.5 percent benchmark last week.  \par \par \uc2 MARKETS-\b \highlight22\uc2 ROMANIA\b0 \highlight\uc2 -\b \highlight22\uc2 INTERVENTION\b0 \highlight\uc2  (UPDATE 2)|LANGEN|RDN|ABN|M|D|BNX|DNP  \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020050817e18h000qs\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
