\par\par \b \uc2 UPDATE 2- \highlight22\uc2 Romania \highlight\uc2  c.bank  \highlight22\uc2 intervenes \highlight\uc2  to hold back leu  \b0\par\par\uc2 By Radu Marinas  \par \uc2 521 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 12 August 2005\par 11:58\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2005 Reuters Limited  \par \par \uc2 (Adds leu close, analyst's quote, background)  \par \par \uc2 BUCHAREST, Aug 12 (Reuters) - Romania's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  (BNR) stepped into the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market on Friday, soaking up hefty hard currrency surpluses in a bid to cap a leu \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  appreciation against the euro, dealers said.  \par \par \uc2 It was the first time in months that dealers had spotted the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  moving directly on the leu -- which firmed to the sensitive level of 3.4 against the euro this week -- after sporadic \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  through commercial banks.  \par \par \uc2 Analysts said the move was aimed at weakening the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  as much as possible before Monday, when the bank shifts to direct inflation targeting, which would limit its \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  powers to increasingly focus on rates.  \par \par \uc2 "It (the BNR) \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  in waves when the leu hit bids of 3.4500," said one dealer with a commercial bank in Bucharest.  \par \par \uc2 The leu has been under pressure mostly from non-bank exchange houses unloading excess euros from Romanians working abroad and export-related inflows.  \par \par \uc2 Dealers said the leu's quick advance to around 3.4500 at midday prompted the BNR to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2 . BNR officials were not available for coment.  \par \par \uc2 CHECKING THE LEU  \par \par \uc2 The bank, which rarely comments on its \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2 , was last suspected of purchasing moderate volumes of euros via commercial banks on July 19. It has sporadically moved over the past months to check the rise of the leu, which gained about 11 percent since the start of the year.  \par \par \uc2 The leu slipped to 3.5350/00 after the \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 , which some dealers estimated to be worth up to 200 million euros. It closed at 3.5390/50 against Thursday's 3.4570/25.  \par \par \uc2 The BNR switches to inflation-targeting next week as part of efforts to curb price growth in preparation for EU entry in 2007. Economists said the new policy would put more pressure on the bank to allow the leu to strengthen.  \par \par \uc2 Romania aims to cut consumer price inflation to 7-7.5 percent this year from 9.3 in 2004, and 2-3 percent in the next three-four years, but analysts see the target as optimistic given mainly the energy price adjustments needed for EU entry.  \par \par \uc2 Last week, BNR vice-governor Cristian Popa told Reuters the bank would keep its managed-float regime for the leu for at least a few more years after the shift to inflation targeting.  \par \par \uc2 "Today's \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  illustrates the bank's policy dilemma. It is worried about increasing inflationary pressures that could be reduced by accepting a leu appreciation," said Lars Christensen of Danske Bank. "On the other hand it sees the recent appreciation as excessive."  \par \par \uc2 Analysts said the bank will not let the unit breach the 3.4000 level in the weeks following the policy shift.  \par \par \uc2 "In the coming weeks the BNR will be reluctant to see the euro/leu rate move below the 3.4000 mark. I would expect them to sporadically \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2 ," said Bank Austria Creditanstalt analyst Simon Quijano-Evans.  \par \par \uc2 MARKETS-\b \highlight22\uc2 ROMANIA\b0 \highlight\uc2 -\b \highlight22\uc2 INTERVENTION\b0 \highlight\uc2  (UPDATE 2)|LANGEN|ABN|M|D|RDN|DNP  \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020050812e18c000y7\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
