\par\par \b \uc2 Romania July  \highlight22\uc2 Forex \highlight\uc2  Reserves EUR14.85B, +EUR1.082B On Mo  \b0\par\par\uc2 209 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 3 August 2005\par 11:00\par \uc2 Dow Jones Emerging Markets Report\par \uc2 EM\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2005 Dow Jones & Company, Inc.  \par \par \uc2 BUCHAREST (Dow Jones)--The National Bank of Romania's \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign-exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  reserves rose EUR1.082 billion in July, to EUR14.85 billion, the bank said Wednesday.  \par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  didn't release a breakdown of the monthly inflows and outflows, but said inflows totaled EUR1.663 billion, while outflows totaled EUR580.2 million.  \par \par \uc2 Last month, National Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Romania\b0 \highlight\uc2  Governor Mugur Isarescu said the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  continues to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the local \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign-exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market, albeit less frequently than in the past, to keep the local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 's appreciation in check.  \par \par \uc2 With the government unable to stem the widening of the current account deficit through fiscal measures, Isarescu said the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  would be "irresponsible to stimulate the current account deficit through an excessive appreciation of the leu."  \par \par \uc2 The leu (EUR1=RON3.4776) has appreciated by some 14% against the euro this year.  \par \par \uc2 In addition to \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign-exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  reserves, the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  reported holdings of 105 metric tons of gold, with a total market value of EUR1.192 billion.  \par \par \uc2 Romania's remaining foreign debt service for 2005 totals EUR723 million.  \par \par \uc2 -By Cristi Cretzan, Dow Jones Newswires; (4021) 210-8197; cristi.cretzan@dowjones.com [ 03-08-05 0901GMT ]  \par \par \uc2 Dokument EM00000020050803e18300005\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
