ice for 2005 totals EUR723 million.  \par \par \uc2 -By Cristi Cretzan, Dow Jones Newswires; (4021) 210-8197; cristi.cretzan@dowjones.com  \par \par \uc2 (END) Dow Jones Newswires  \par \par \uc2 08-03-05 0501ET  \par \par \uc2 Dokument OSTDJ00020050803e183002mh\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
