\par\par \b \uc2 Romanian leu flat, c.bank  \highlight22\uc2 intervention \highlight\uc2  suspected  \b0\par\par\uc2 496 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 14 Juli 2005\par 18:16\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2005 Reuters Limited  \par \par \uc2 BUCHAREST, July 14 (Reuters) - \b \highlight22\uc2 Romania\b0 \highlight\uc2 's leu <EURRON=> failed to extend recent its gains versus the euro on Thursday, closing unchanged from the previous session, with some dealers saying the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  might have \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  again to slow its rise.  \par \par \uc2 The unit firmed early in the quiet session to touch fresh five-month highs of 3.5600 to the euro briefly as corporates as well as some speculators sold euros.  \par \par \uc2 The leu returned to weaker levels soon afterwards in what traders said seemed to be a moderate \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  (BNR) \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  through a commercial bank. It closed at 3.5640/80 against the euro, unchanged from Wednesday.  \par \par \uc2 "We are not sure but our opinion is that the BNR \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  (against the leu) through another bank. But it was only moderate," one dealer said.  \par \par \uc2 The BNR has been fighting the leu's increasing strength for months, mainly trying to discourage hot-money inflows by covert hard \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  purchases.  \par \par \uc2 The monetary body initially kept off the market after the introduction of the new heavy leu on July 1, but dealers suspected it started correcting leu moves again earlier this week after the unit gained roughly one percent over the past two weeks.  \par \par \uc2 The BNR, usually tight-lipped about market actions, did not comment on the exchange rate movements in recent days.  \par \par \uc2 Dealers said the BNR probably only wanted to slow the leu's appreciation as a stronger exchange rate helps it in its fight with stubborn inflation, adding the unit was set for testing 3.550 per euro in the short term.  \par \par \uc2 "My opinion is that they (the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) still want the leu to appreciate, but they do not want to see a very sharp rise," another dealer said.  \par \par \uc2 Short-term money market rates ended at 7.13/8.11 percent, compared with 7.16/8.11 percent on Wednesday.  \par \par \uc2 The BNR drained 1.6 billion lei worth of one-month deposits from the market on Thursday at an average accepted interest rate of 8.0 percent <BNR13>.  \par \par \uc2 It also raised 2.5 billion lei in Thursday's auction of 91-day deposit certificates at an average yield of 8.02 percent. Total demand in the auction reached 3.9 billion <BNR053>.  \par \par \uc2 On Thursday, the finance ministry said it had sold 150 million lei worth of its three-year bond at an average yield of 7.72 percent, slightly lower than 7.74 percent seen in the previous sale last month. Bids totalled 348.8 million <BNR040>.  \par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  computed the indicative rate of the leu <FXRO01> at 3.5680 to the euro versus 3.5704 on Wednesday. It was 2.9532 to the dollar from 2.9329. The rate is not compulsory for book-keeping or interbank deals. It is used by the Finance Ministry and customs for statistical purposes.  \par \par \uc2 MARKETS-ROMANIA-LEU|LANGEN|Table|ABN|M|D|RDN|GNN|RBN|RNP|DNP|PTD|PMF  \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020050714e17e001tt\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
