\par\par \b \uc2 Romanian leu firms vs euro after c.bank  \highlight22\uc2 intervenes \highlight\uc2 .  \b0\par\par\uc2 272 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 28 November 2003\par 16:27\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2003 Reuters Limited  \par \par \uc2 1510 GMT - \b \highlight22\uc2 Romania\b0 \highlight\uc2 's leu closed stronger at 40,220/50 to the euro on Friday from Thursday's 40,320/40, after erasing intraday lows following \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  (BNR) \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 , dealers said.  \par \par \uc2 The BNR sold euros on the local market in a move seen aimed at tempering a faster fall of the leu versus the euro as a result of euro/dollar rate moves on world markets, coupled with greater importer demand.  \par \par \uc2 * On world markets, the dollar tumbled to a record low against the euro on Friday, trading at $1.2015.  \par \par \uc2 Dealers said the leu, which had fallen to 40,370/00 when the BNR stepped in at midday, bounced back to 40,220/70 after the \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 . The size of the \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  was estimated at roughly 20 million euros.  \par \par \uc2 Operators see the leu tracking the euro/dollar moves next Tuesday. \b \highlight22\uc2 Foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2 , money and capital markets are closed next Monday as Romania celebrates its national day.  \par \par \uc2 * Short-term money market rates were unchanged at 20/22 percent in and traders see them flat up to the end of the month.  \par \par \uc2 The BNR drained a lower-than-planned 1.69 trillion lei of one-month deposits at its daily open-market-\b \highlight22\uc2 operations\b0 \highlight\uc2  at an average interest rate of 21.25 percent .  \par \par \uc2 * The BNR computed the indicative rate of the leu at 40,193 to the euro from 40,289. It was 33,523 to the dollar from 33,829. The rate is not compulsory for book-keeping or interbank deals, but is used by the Finance Ministry and customs for statistical purposes.   \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020031128dzbs00382\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
