\par\par \b \uc2  Romanian leu ends firmer, off lows on  \highlight22\uc2 intervention \highlight\uc2 . \b0\par\par\uc2 220 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 9 Mai 2003\par 16:53\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2003 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  BUCHAREST, May 9 (Reuters) - \b \highlight22\uc2 Romania\b0 \highlight\uc2 's leu  closed firmer at 37,460/520 to the euro on Friday from Thursday's 37,620/680, after erasing intraday losses following \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  (BNR) \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 , dealers said. \par \par \uc2  They said the leu went as low as 37,780/800 in response to the euro-dollar moves on world markets. \par \par \uc2  Then the BNR stepped in and sold what one dealer estimated at more than 20 million euros on the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market to temper a quickening depreciation of the unit. \par \par \uc2  They saw the leu easing in the weeks ahead. \par \par \uc2  Short-term money market rates hovered at 15/19 percent and traders foresee stable rates in the coming days. \par \par \uc2  The BNR soaked up a lower-than-planned 2.93 trillion lei in one-month deposits at an average rate of 18.21 percent against 18.25 percent on Thursday . \par \par \uc2  The BNR computed the indicative rate of the leu  at 37,502 to the euro from 37,515. It was 32,630 to the dollar from 33,040. The rate is not compulsory for book-keeping or interbank deals, but is used by the Finance Ministry and customs for statistical purposes. \par \par \uc2  Against the dollar, the leu ended firmer at 32,620/670 from Thursday's 32,780/790. \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020030509dz5900sk6\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
