\par\par \b \uc2  UPDATE 1- \highlight22\uc2 Romania \highlight\uc2  c.bank  \highlight22\uc2 intervenes \highlight\uc2  to temper leu slide. \b0\par\par\uc2 310 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 9 Mai 2003\par 14:26\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2003 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  BUCHAREST, May 9 (Reuters) - \b \highlight22\uc2 Romania\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  (BNR) sold euros on the local \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market at midday to ease a depreciation of the leu \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 , dealers said on Friday. \par \par \uc2  The BNR's action seemed aimed at tempering the quickening slide of the leu versus the euro - Romania's reference \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  - in response to recent euro-dollar moves on world markets. \par \par \uc2  "It (the BNR) entered the market in waves as the leu slipped to 37,780/800 in the early hours," said a dealer with a foreign bank in Bucharest. "I think it sold more than 20 million euros." \par \par \uc2  The leu firmed to around 37,480/520 to the euro after the \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  and dealers saw it hovering around this level by close. The unit ended trading on Thursday at 37,620/680. \par \par \uc2  BNR officials declined to comment on Friday's \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  Analysts said that apart from the psychological impact on the public, a steeper decline of the leu to the euro, if continued, might induce some inflationary pressures as Romanian excise duties are tied to the euro. \par \par \uc2  Year on year inflation is forecast to fall to 14 percent in 2003 from 17.8 percent last year. \par \par \uc2  "One cannot assume that a faster depreciation of the leu in the first half of the year could be offset by a recovery later on," said one independent analyst. \par \par \uc2  The leu was trading at around 34,900/970 to the euro at the beginning of this year. \par \par \uc2  Last month, the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  said it wanted to attain an appreciation in real terms of the leu of about four percent versus a euro-dollar basket. \par \par \uc2  The Balkan country switched to the euro from the dollar as its reference \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  in March to better reflect the weight of the eurozone on its foreign trade. \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020030509dz5900odw\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
