\par\par \b \uc2  Romanian Leu Up Vs Dlr Early; Rise Seen Continuing \b0\par\par\uc2 283 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 21 Juli 1999\par 09:55\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1999, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  BUCHAREST (Dow Jones)--The Romanian leu (ROL) is stronger against the dollar early Wednesday and is expected to continue to appreciate unless the National Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Romania intervenes\b0 \highlight\uc2  to buy dollar surplus, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  At 0740 GMT, the dollar was between ROL15,930 and ROL15,960, down from between ROL15,985 and ROL16,010 late Tuesday. \par \par \uc2  Market participants said the leu appreciation in early trading was caused mainly by increasing dollar sales by profit-takers together with corporate demand for leu to meet end of the month payments. \par \par \uc2  A dealer at a foreign bank in Bucharest said the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  is expected to buy dollar surplus in the market to halt the leu's appreciation. "It isn't normal to have such appreciation (of the leu)," the dealer said. \par \par \uc2  Money market rates continued to be quoted at high levels early Wednesday as a result of the new minimum reserve requirements which came into effect Friday. The rise in commercial banks' minimum reserve requirements to 20% from 15% has drained leu liquidity and increased money market rates to levels around 100%. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  was hoping the measure would push interest rates down, allowing the Finance Ministry to sell Treasury bills at lower yields to finance public debt. \par \par \uc2  On Tuesday, the ministry sold ROL554.14 billion in three-month T-bills at an annual average yield of 74.77%. \par \par \uc2  The overnight money market rate was quoted early Wednesday at between 80% and 120%, while the one-week deposit rate was quoted at between 75% and 130%. \par \par \uc2  -By Cristi Cretzan; (401) 210-8197; ccretzan@\b \highlight22\uc2 fx\b0 \highlight\uc2 .ro \par \par \uc2  (END) Dow Jones Newswires 21-07-99 \par \par \uc2  0755GMT \par \par \uc2  1869 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010826dv7l05gq8\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
