\par\par \b \uc2  Romanian Leu Dn Vs Dlr; Higher Reserves Sow Confusion \b0\par\par\uc2 247 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 19 Juli 1999\par 09:49\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1999, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  BUCHAREST (Dow Jones)--The Romanian leu (ROL) is slightly lower against the dollar early Monday, with dealers reluctant to forecast a pattern for the day as they try to make sense of a rise in the minimum reserve requirement for banks. \par \par \uc2  At 0730 GMT, the dollar was trading at between ROL15,960 and ROL15,990, up from between ROL15,955 and ROL15,980 late Friday. \par \par \uc2  Market participants said the money market is still unstable as banks try to adapt to the new minimum reserve requirements which came into effect Friday. The rise in commercial banks' minimum reserve requirements to 20% from 15% has drained leu liquidity and increased money market rates to levels around 100%. \par \par \uc2  The overnight money market rate was quoted early Monday at between 95% and 125%, while the one-week deposit rate was quoted at between 80% and 125%. \par \par \uc2  On the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market, the leu has been seen supported by a slight \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  from the National Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Romania\b0 \highlight\uc2 , which sold few million dollars Friday as the dollar traded above ROL16,000, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  Market players said the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  would allow just a slow depreciation of the leu, which must be in line with the level of inflation. June inflation rose by 5.1% on the month, following a 5.3% raise in May. \par \par \uc2  -By Cristi Cretzan; (401) 210-8197; ccretzan@\b \highlight22\uc2 fx\b0 \highlight\uc2 .ro \par \par \uc2  (END) Dow Jones Newswires 19-07-99 \par \par \uc2  0749GMT \par \par \uc2  1869 \par \par \uc2 Dokument d