\par\par \b \uc2  Romanian Leu Stable Vs Dlr Early; Steady Session Seen \b0\par\par\uc2 248 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 24 Juni 1999\par 09:52\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1999, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  BUCHAREST (Dow Jones)--The Romanian leu (ROL) is little changed against the dollar in calm trade early Thursday and is seen ending the session around its current levels, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  At 0740 GMT, the dollar was trading between ROL15,750 and ROL15,780, hardly changed from late Wednesday. \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  dealers said that it is hard to make a precise estimation of the leu's movements over the day, but they see it trading within ROL15,700 and ROL15,800. \par \par \uc2  The leu's appreciation trend in recent days was halted by an \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  from the National Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Romania\b0 \highlight\uc2  Wednesday. The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  was seen buying about $10 million in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market to offset dollar selling pressure from companies that needed lei for end-month payments. The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  bought dollars in the range of ROL15,690 and ROL15,740, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  Market players said the leu might begin to fall against the dollar next week as soon as leu demand ends and banks become interested in restoring their dollar positions. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  Wednesday continued refusing to renew some of the banks' leu deposits, to keep money market interest rates at low levels, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  On Thursday, the overnight rate was at between 20% and 40%, while the rate for one-week deposits was between 50% and 85%. \par \par \uc2  -By Cristi Cretzan; (401) 210-8197; ccretzan@\b \highlight22\uc2 fx\b0 \highlight\uc2 .ro \par \par \uc2  (END) Dow Jones Newswires 24-06-99 \par \par \uc2  0752GMT \par \par \uc2  1869 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010826dv6o04q8d\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
