\par\par \b \uc2  Romanian Leu Up Vs Dlr Early; Seen Closing At Curr Levels \b0\par\par\uc2 273 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 23 Juni 1999\par 10:01\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1999, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  BUCHAREST (Dow Jones)--The Romanian leu (ROL) is stronger against the dollar early Wednesday as companies sell dollars for lei to meet month-end payments, and is seen ending the day around its current levels, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  At 0725 GMT, the dollar was trading between ROL15,670 and ROL15,695, down from ROL15,690 and ROL15,720 late Tuesday. \par \par \uc2  They said that, if the leu continues to appreciate on corporate demand for the Romanian \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 , the National Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Romania\b0 \highlight\uc2 , the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 , would \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  to halt the rise. \par \par \uc2  Dealers also said that any dollar buying from the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  would trigger dollar demand from banks, pushing the leu down. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  governor, Mugur Isarescu said late Tuesday that a significant appreciation of the leu in the coming months is improbable, local television reported. \par \par \uc2  As reported Tuesday he said the inflation at the end of the year is expected to be higher than the government target of 35%. In June, inflation is expected to raise at 4% to 5% on the month, following a 5.3% raise in May. \par \par \uc2  Dealers said the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  Tuesday refused to renew the banks' leu deposits, in a move aimed at pushing interest rates down. \par \par \uc2  As a result, in the money market Wednesday, the overnight rate was at between 20% and 45%, down from 65% and 80% Tuesday, while the rate for one-week deposits was between 40% and 80%, down from 60% and 85% Tuesday. \par \par \uc2  -By Cristi Cretzan; (401) 210-8197; ccretzan@\b \highlight22\uc2 fx\b0 \highlight\uc2 .ro \par \par \uc2  (END) Dow Jones Newswires 23-06-99 \par \par \uc2  0801GMT \par \par \uc2  1869 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010826dv6n04r2o\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
