\par\par \b \uc2  Romanian Leu Up Vs Dlr Early; Seen Rising Slightly \b0\par\par\uc2 224 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 22 Juni 1999\par 10:07\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1999, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  BUCHAREST (Dow Jones)--The Romanian leu (ROL) is stronger against the dollar early Tuesday as companies sell dollars for lei to meet month-end payments, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  At 0700 GMT, the dollar was trading between ROL15,710 and ROL15,750, down from ROL15,775 and ROL15,800 late Monday. \par \par \uc2  Dealers said the leu might continue to appreciate slightly for the rest of the session on leu demand from companies. \par \par \uc2  They however ruled out any major appreciation in the Romanian \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  as they see speculators stepping in to sell the leu on any significant rise. \par \par \uc2  Market participants forecast a volatile trading week for the leu as Romania must redeem Friday $250 million in maturing eurobonds. \par \par \uc2  Traders however don't see the redemption hurting the leu much as the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  can meet these payments by dipping into its reserves. Besides, the amount isn't large they add. \par \par \uc2  Yet, traders said they expect volatility on speculative trade. The National Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Romania\b0 \highlight\uc2  is however likely to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  to prevent any major fluctuation. \par \par \uc2  In the money market Tuesday, the overnight rate was at between 65% and 80%, while the rate for one-week deposits was between 60% and 85%. \par \par \uc2  -By Cristi Cretzan; (401) 210-8197; ccretzan@\b \highlight22\uc2 fx\b0 \highlight\uc2 .ro \par \par \uc2  (END) Dow Jones Newswires 22-06-99 \par \par \uc2  0807GMT \par \par \uc2  1869 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010826dv6m04sgi\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict