\par\par \b \uc2  Romanian Leu Lower Vs Dlr Early; Volatile Trade Seen \b0\par\par\uc2 279 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 21 Juni 1999\par 09:50\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1999, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  BUCHAREST (Dow Jones)--The Romanian leu (ROL) is lower against the dollar early Monday and dealers forecast trading to be volatile for the rest of the session, ahead of Friday's eurobonds redemption. \par \par \uc2  At 0740 GMT, the dollar was trading between ROL15,800 and ROL15,850, up from ROL15,790 and ROL15,825 late Friday. \par \par \uc2  Dealers said there might be a hectic trade for the leu this week as Romania must redeem Friday $250 million maturing eurobonds. \par \par \uc2  They said there won't be any direct effect on the leu caused by the Eurobond payment, but speculative trade may flourish. \par \par \uc2  However, market participants said the National Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Romania\b0 \highlight\uc2 , the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 , would \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the market to prevent any major depreciation of the leu. \par \par \uc2  On Friday, the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  sold around $10 million to halt the leu's fall as the dollar was traded at between ROL15,850 and ROL15,900. It is the first time in several weeks that the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has sold dollars to halt the leu's depreciation. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has been seen more as a dollar buyer recently. \b \highlight22\uc2 Central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  officials said the bank bought about $80 million in the market in June, in addition to $100 million bought in May. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  needs dollars to boost its \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  reserves, which were depleted by foreign debt payment. \par \par \uc2  In the money market Monday, the overnight rate was at between 70% and 90%, while the rate for one-week deposits was between 80% and 100%. \par \par \uc2  -By Cristi Cretzan; (401) 210-8197; ccretzan@\b \highlight22\uc2 fx\b0 \highlight\uc2 .ro \par \par \uc2  (END) Dow Jones Newswires 21-06-99 \par \par \uc2  0750GMT \par \par \uc2  1869 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010826dv6l04ofu\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
