\par\par \b \uc2  Romanian Leu Lower Vs Dlr Early; Slight Fall Seen \b0\par\par\uc2 209 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 2 Juni 1999\par 09:51\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1999, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  BUCHAREST (Dow Jones)--The Romanian leu (ROL) is lower against the dollar in early trade Wednesday, with dealers predicting the unit might continue to fall slightly by the end of the session. \par \par \uc2  At 0725 GMT, the dollar was trading between ROL15,680 and ROL15,710, up from between ROL15,625 and ROL15,650 late Tuesday. \par \par \uc2  Dealers said the leu's depreciation in early trading was caused by dollar demand from both importers and commercial banks. They added however that there isn't a lot of pressure on the leu. \par \par \uc2  Dealers said the National Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Romania\b0 \highlight\uc2 , the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 , might \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the money market to drain leu liquidity if the leu's depreciation rate rises. \par \par \uc2  Last week, the leu depreciated 0.8% and the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  was seen buying small amounts of dollars to boost its \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  reserves. Reserves were depleted by the payment Friday of a maturing Y52 billion Samurai bond. \par \par \uc2  On the money market Wednesday, the overnight rate was quoted at between 40% and 65%, while the rate for one-week deposits was quoted between 65% and 100%. \par \par \uc2  -By Cristi Cretzan; (401) 210-8197; ccretzan@\b \highlight22\uc2 fx\b0 \highlight\uc2 .ro \par \par \uc2  (END) Dow Jones Newswires 02-06-99 \par \par \uc2  0751GMT \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010826dv620493e\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
