\par\par \b \uc2  Romanian Leu Lower Vs Dlr Early; Volatile Trading Seen \b0\par\par\uc2 235 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 28 Mai 1999\par 10:04\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1999, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  BUCHAREST (Dow Jones)--The Romanian leu (ROL) is lower against the dollar in early trade Friday, with dealers predicting volatile trading for the rest of the session. \par \par \uc2  At 0720 GMT, the dollar was trading between ROL15,640 and ROL15,700, up from between ROL15,570 and ROL15,640 late Thursday. \par \par \uc2  Dealers said leu's depreciation in the past week reflects \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  by the National Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Romania\b0 \highlight\uc2  on both \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  and money markets. The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  was seen buying small amounts of dollars and attracting leu deposits at rates above 10 0%. \par \par \uc2  Pressure on the leu hadn't been strong and dollar demand from importers was low. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  needs dollars to boost its \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  reserves, which will be depleted by the heavy debt service schedule in May and June. On Friday, Romania must redeem a Y52 billion Samurai Eurobond. Another $250 million Eurobond issue mature s June 25. \par \par \uc2  Romania has already deposited the funds to cover the Samurai bonds, resulting in reserves declining to around $1 billion from about $1.44 billion at end-April. \par \par \uc2  On the money market Friday, the overnight rate was quoted at between 60% and 90%, while the rate for one-week deposits was quoted at between 70% and 115%. \par \par \uc2  -By Cristi Cretzan; (401) 210-8197; ccretzan@\b \highlight22\uc2 fx\b0 \highlight\uc2 .r \par \par \uc2  (END) Dow Jones Newswires 28-05-99 \par \par \uc2 