\par\par \b \uc2  Romanian Leu Up Vs Dlr Early; Seen Falling Again \b0\par\par\uc2 242 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 19 Mai 1999\par 09:38\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1999, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  BUCHAREST (Dow Jones)--The Romanian leu (ROL) is stronger against the dollar early Wednesday in volatile trading. Dealers predict the leu will depreciate by the end of the session unless the National Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Romania\b0 \highlight\b \highlight22\uc2 intervenes\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the market. \par \par \uc2  At 0725 GMT, the dollar was trading between ROL15,380 and ROL15,450, down from between ROL15,450 and ROL15,570 late Tuesday. \par \par \uc2  Dealers said the leu opened the session lower Wednesday with the dollar trading at between ROL15,550 and ROL15,650 but it appreciated soon amid dollar sales from some banks. However, dealers said the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  might be forced to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  on the market by selling dollars to halt the leu depreciation. \par \par \uc2  The market has been volatile this week, with the leu falling by 1.5% Tuesday. The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  on the money market Tuesday and attracted leu deposits at high rates to divert banks from investing in dollars. \par \par \uc2  Some dealers at foreign banks in Bucharest said the leu's depreciation was caused mainly by speculative trading from some banks. \par \par \uc2  Since the beginning of the year, the leu has fallen by about 29%. \par \par \uc2  On the money market Wednesday, the overnight rate was quoted at between 40% and 80%, while the rate for one-week deposits was quoted at between 50% and 100%. \par \par \uc2  -By Cristi Cretzan; (401) 210 8197; ccretzan@\b \highlight22\uc2 fx\b0 \highlight\uc2 .ro \par \par \uc2  (END) Dow Jones Newswires 19-05-99 \par \par \uc2  0738GMT \par