\par\par \b \uc2  Romanian Leu Lower Vs Dlr Early; Further Fall Seen \b0\par\par\uc2 231 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 18 Mai 1999\par 09:30\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1999, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  BUCHAREST (Dow Jones)--The Romanian leu (ROL) is lower against the dollar early Tuesday, with dealers predicting that the unit might continue to fall if the National Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Romania\b0 \highlight\uc2  doesn't \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the market. \par \par \uc2  At 0715 GMT, the dollar was trading between ROL15,400 and ROL15,460, up from between ROL15,250 and ROL15,300 late Tuesday. \par \par \uc2  Dealers said the leu's depreciation came unexpectedly after some dollar demand from a few banks. "There are no large buying orders," said one dealer. But he said the leu's depreciation might rise due to psychological pressure if the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  doesn't \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the market. \par \par \uc2  So far, the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  was seen \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  slightly Monday to attract leu deposits on the money market. A \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  spokesman was quoted by local media as saying that leu's volatility is "normal" and there are no reasons for concerns. \par \par \uc2  The leu has fallen by about 1.2% over the past three sessions. Since the beginning of the year, the leu fell by about 28.5%. \par \par \uc2  On the money market Tuesday, the overnight rate was quoted at between 60% and 80%, while the rate for one-week deposits was quoted at between 60% and 100%. \par \par \uc2  -By Cristi Cretzan; (401) 210-8197; ccretzan@\b \highlight22\uc2 fx\b0 \highlight\uc2 .ro \par \par \uc2  (END) Dow Jones Newswires 18-05-99 \par \par \uc2  0730GMT \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010826dv5i03syi\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
