\par\par \b \uc2  Romanian Leu Slightly Lower Vs Dlr Early; Seen Stable \b0\par\par\uc2 335 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 16 April 1999\par 09:35\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1999, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  BUCHAREST (Dow Jones)--The Romanian leu (ROL) is slightly lower against the dollar early Friday, with dealers predicting it will remain around the current levels over the day. \par \par \uc2  At 0720 GMT, the dollar was between ROL14,860 and ROL14,910, up from between ROL14,800 and ROL14,900 late Thursday. \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  dealers said the leu is likely to remain stable amid tight control from the National Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Romania\b0 \highlight\uc2 . The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  was seen \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  again Thursday, selling small amounts of dollars above the ROL15,000 level. \par \par \uc2  "The (\b \highlight22\uc2 central) bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  clearly signaled that it wants to maintain the exchange rate at below ROL15,000 per dollar," a dealer at a foreign bank in Bucharest said. \par \par \uc2  The overnight money market rate was quoted between 80% and 150%, up from 40% and 80% Thursday, while the rate for one-week deposits was quoted between 80% and 180%, from 50% and 100% Thursday. \par \par \uc2  The high interest rates on money markets make it more and more difficult for the \b \highlight22\uc2 Ministry of Finance\b0 \highlight\uc2  to sell Treasury bills and finance the budget deficit. On Thursday, the ministry rejected banks' bids for a ROL500 billion T-bill auction, saying the yields offered were too low. \par \par \uc2  But also Thursday, the ministry sold ROL1 trillion in 15-day T-bills and ROL750 billion in one-week T-bills, both paying a 95% annual yield. Some \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  dealers said the transactions were dubious, because these particular auctions were, unusually, not announced in advance and only four state-owned banks participated. \par \par \uc2  Market observers said the leu might become more stable in the coming weeks after the government agrees with the International Monetary Fund on a new financial agreement for Romania. \par \par \uc2  Romanian finance minister Decebal Traian Remes was quoted as saying Thursday that the letter of intent for a new stand-by loan will be signed on April 20. \par \par \uc2  -By Cristi Cretzan; (401) 210-8197; ccretzan@\b \highlight22\uc2 fx\b0 \highlight\uc2 .ro \par \par \uc2  (END) Dow Jones Newswires 16-04-99 \par \par \uc2  0735GMT \par \par \uc2  1869 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010826dv4g02whe\par }\par \b \uc2 Zusammenfassung der Suche\b0\par \par  \trowd\trgaph15\trqc\trleft-15 \clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx2000\clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx9072\pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\intbl\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0 \uc2 Text\cell \pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\intbl\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0 \li50\uc2 (foreign exchange or fx or forex or currenc*) and (interven* or operation*) and (Romania near10 interven*) and (rst=trtw or rst=tprw or rst=tdjw) and (central bank or ministry of finance or treasury ministry or monetary authority)\cell \pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0 {  \trowd\trgaph15\trqc\trleft-15 \clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx2000\clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx9072\row } \trowd\trgaph15\trqc\trleft-15 \clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx2000\clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx9072\pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\intbl\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0 \uc2 Datum\cell \pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\intbl\aspa